# Accepted risks, reviewed on 2026-10-05.

# AWS-0089: S3 access logging on the Terraform state bucket.
# State access is already audited through CloudTrail data events in a real
# account; a separate log bucket would add cost and another stack to manage.
AWS-0089

# AWS-0017: CloudWatch log group for VPC flow logs uses the default AWS-managed
# encryption instead of a customer-managed KMS key. Flow logs contain no secrets;
# a dedicated CMK costs about $1/month per key and is planned for prod.
AWS-0017
